# Project & Tooling

**Nx** monorepo on **Yarn 1 workspaces** with two apps:

- `apps/desktop` (`@orbit/desktop`, Nx project `desktop`) — the **Tauri 2** launcher. TypeScript frontend + Rust backend.
- `apps/landing` (`@orbit/landing`, Nx project `landing`) — the **Next.js** landing site with install guide and versioned downloads. See [LANDING.md](LANDING.md).

Unless a path starts with `apps/`, paths in the desktop docs (DESIGN_DOC, TAURI, FRONTEND, UI, THEMES) are relative to `apps/desktop/`.

Related docs: [DESIGN_DOC.mdc](DESIGN_DOC.mdc), [TAURI.mdc](TAURI.mdc), [FRONTEND.mdc](FRONTEND.mdc), [UI.mdc](UI.mdc), [LANDING.md](LANDING.md).

Root guides: [README.md](../README.md), [RUNNING.md](../RUNNING.md), [CONTRIBUTING.md](../CONTRIBUTING.md).

