## Repository layout

```
orbit/
  apps/
    desktop/               # Tauri desktop app (@orbit/desktop)
      src/                 # React frontend (Vite)
        app/               # App shell, providers
        modules/           # Screen-level modules (pages + colocated UI)
        components/        # Shared UI
        controllers/       # Gamepad + spatial focus
        hooks/             # React hooks
        stores/            # Zustand state
        themes/            # Built-in theme definitions + layout hooks
        lib/               # Tauri wrappers, formatters, artwork helpers
        types/             # Shared TS types
        styles/            # Global CSS + theme tokens
      src-tauri/           # Rust backend
        src/
          commands/        # Tauri invoke handlers
          database/        # SQLite migrations + repository
          importers/       # Platform importers
          launching/       # Launch + process monitor + sessions
          models/          # Shared Rust structs
          services/        # Library sync, artwork
          utils/           # Paths, filenames, size
        icons/             # App icons
        Cargo.toml
      e2e/                 # Playwright specs
      package.json         # Desktop deps + version (source of truth for releases)
      vite.config.ts, vitest.config.ts, playwright.config.ts, tailwind.config.js
    landing/               # Next.js landing site (@orbit/landing)
      src/app/             # Routes: /, /install, /download, /download/[version]
      src/components/      # layout/, home/, download/, install/
      src/lib/             # GitHub Releases fetch + parsing, formatters
      public/              # Logo, screenshots
  scripts/                 # Release, version sync, cleanup, agent skill sync
  tools/                   # Research helpers (not shipped)
  docs/                    # Design & architecture docs
  .cursor/rules/           # Cursor agent rules
  .cursor/skills/          # Agent skills (source of truth)
  .claude/skills/          # Copy of .cursor/skills for Claude Code
  .opencode/skills/        # Copy of .cursor/skills for OpenCode
  AGENTS.md                # Shared agent instructions (Cursor, Claude Code, OpenCode)
  CLAUDE.md                # Claude Code entry point → AGENTS.md
  .mcp.json, opencode.json # MCP servers for Claude Code / OpenCode (mirror .cursor/mcp.json)
  nx.json                  # Nx task defaults + caching
  package.json             # Workspaces + root scripts (delegate to Nx)
```

Each app's `package.json` scripts are its Nx targets (`yarn nx run desktop:test:rust`,
`yarn nx run landing:build`, …). `yarn nx show projects` lists them.

