## Scripts

Root scripts (run from the repo root):

| Script | Runs | Description |
| ------ | ---- | ----------- |
| `dev` | `nx run desktop:dev` | Desktop frontend only (mock Tauri API) |
| `dev:landing` | `nx run landing:dev` | Landing site on `http://localhost:3000` |
| `tauri:dev` | `nx run desktop:tauri:dev` | Full desktop app in development |
| `tauri:build` | `nx run desktop:tauri:build` | Release `.app` bundle |
| `release:macos` | `bash scripts/release-macos.sh` | Build + package macOS artifacts to `release/<version>/` |
| `monopipeline` | `node scripts/monopipeline.mjs` | Bump version and scaffold CHANGELOG + GitHub release notes |
| `build` | `nx run-many -t build` | Desktop (typecheck + Vite) and landing (Next.js) builds |
| `build:desktop` / `build:landing` | `nx run <app>:build` | Build one app |
| `typecheck` | `nx run-many -t typecheck` | TypeScript for both apps |
| `format` | `prettier --write .` | Format all files |
| `format:check` | `prettier --check .` | CI-style format gate |
| `test:rust` | `nx run desktop:test:rust` | Rust unit tests |
| `test:unit` | `nx run-many -t test:unit` | Vitest for both apps |
| `test:e2e` | `nx run desktop:test:e2e` | Desktop Playwright E2E (builds desktop first) |
| `test:e2e:ui` | `yarn workspace @orbit/desktop test:e2e:ui` | Playwright UI mode |
| `sync:skills` | `bash scripts/sync-agent-skills.sh` | Copy `.cursor/skills` to `.claude/skills` and `.opencode/skills` |
| `check:skills` | `bash scripts/sync-agent-skills.sh --check` | Fail if agent skill copies drifted |

Typical dev loop:

```bash
yarn install
yarn tauri:dev
```

