## Quality gates

Defined in `.cursor/rules/quality-gating.mdc`. Run before declaring work done:

```bash
yarn run format:check
yarn run typecheck
yarn run test:unit      # when src/lib/, landing, or unit-tested helpers changed
yarn run test:rust      # when apps/desktop/src-tauri/ changed
yarn run build
yarn run test:e2e       # when desktop UI/navigation/themes changed
```

Nx caches `build`, `typecheck`, `test:unit`, and `test:rust`, so unchanged apps are skipped.
Cursor hooks (`.cursor/hooks.json`) run `typecheck` and `test:rust` after file edits.

